.env
node_modules
*.log
.r2-test-tmp/
.r2-uploads/
# Runtime artifacts of the self-update op. Created on the machine being updated;
# never source. .update-staging/ is transient, .update-backup/ is the rollback
# copy, update-state.json records what that specific machine is running.
.update-staging/
.update-backup/
update-state.json
# Credential-filled copies of the runbooks. This repo is PUBLIC, so a filled
# runbook must never land in git history. They are generated to the Desktop by
# Clients/ES/scripts/robbie-filled-runbook.sh; this is belt-and-braces in case
# one ever gets written in here instead.
*-FILLED.md
